      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "NORTON BALE (2) got around the 390m at Shepparton to take a Grade 5 in a slick 22.23 for a 5 length victory. Expected to go close again if runs up to latest time. SPRING QUIZ (6) was below best at his last couple, the latest finishing fifth at Warrnambool, but was among the placings at this track three back. Well placed here and should do much better. ASTON MORENO (8) jumped from the inside and boxed on well to finish second last time, beaten 0.7 lengths (23.03) behind PAW RAMELLO at Geelong. Expected to feature. PAW RAMELLO (7) took charge early and was never headed last time out. Right in the mix again.",
